ption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜30歲人士常犯的6個理財謬誤！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221125/672894170885263360281709.jpeg/e-SXtpmdnIyrtfo2YDJUXbmyTgnjh2c6tFArz7RQK88\"/><figcaption>理財｜30歲人士常犯的6個理財謬誤！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜30歲人士常犯的6個理財謬誤！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221125/672894173322285056086934.jpeg/PqnpeMOmaOlvJPUoPraRyWDG2Z1SZ6Ymwvq0hsL6tIY\"/><figcaption>理財｜30歲人士常犯的6個理財謬誤！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜30歲人士常犯的6個理財謬誤！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221125/672894175960633344742169.jpeg/AoKxO6CdzCD2MbOnEcZH-79_Fs-HmzYI6qnIJ-qpyCc\"/><figcaption>理財｜30歲人士常犯的6個理財謬誤！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>《大賣空》本尊貝瑞開槍狙擊美光！喊AI晶片恐崩跌30%</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T04:20:28.832122+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1884,"images":32,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}